# Byte-exact everywhere: no line-ending conversion on any machine. The PowerShell here is read by Windows PowerShell 5.1,
# which is sensitive to encodings (BOM / no BOM) and the C# is compiled by Add-Type -- git must hand every file back exactly
# as it was committed. (This overrides core.autocrlf, which Git for Windows turns on by default.)
* -text

# diffs: treat these as binary
*.png binary
*.PCX binary
*.pcx binary
*.RES binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.pal binary
*.sf2 binary
